    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Upon hearing counsel the Court made the following\n O R D E R",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2717,
      "end": 2778,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Heard counsel for the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2778,
      "end": 2808,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "By order dated March 10, 2014, this court directed the Joint Commissioner (Food), Food and Drug Administration, State of Maharashtra, to file an affidavit explaining the inconsistency noticed in the affidavits filed by the State and that of the Assistant Director (Legal), Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, FDA Bhawan, Kotla Road, New Delhi.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2810,
      "end": 3163,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "March 10, 2014",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2825,
          "end": 2839
        },
        {
          "text": "State of Maharashtra",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2922,
          "end": 2942
        },
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards Authority of India",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3083,
          "end": 3127
        },
        {
          "text": "New Delhi",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3153,
          "end": 3162
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.057824261486530304
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "In the earlier affidavit, it was pointed out that during the period 01.04.2012 to 31.03.2012, twelve samples were tested in the State and presence of urea, starch/ bottling paper, glucose/sugar, caustic soda, etc. was found in the milk.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3164,
      "end": 3400,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "01.04.2012",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3232,
          "end": 3242
        },
        {
          "text": "31.03.2012",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3246,
          "end": 3256
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19662609696388245
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Pursuant to the said order, the Joint Commissioner (Food) has filed an affidavit dated March 10,\n2014.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3402,
      "end": 3504,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "March 10,",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3489,
          "end": 3499
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19620399177074432
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "He has tendered an unconditional apology and submitted that due to an inadvertent error, in not striking out urea, detergent from the astrick, while submitting the proforma chart to the Food Safety Authority of India, the mistake has crept in in the affidavit.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3505,
      "end": 3765,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Food Safety Authority of India",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3691,
          "end": 3721
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2717598080635071
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "...4/-",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3766,
      "end": 3773,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "We cannot appreciate the stand taken by the Officer.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3774,
      "end": 3827,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Of late, we have seen that so many affidavits are being filed before this Court without proper verification of the records and when found out, they always pass on the buck on the inferior officer, which practice has to be strongly condemned.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3828,
      "end": 4069,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
