      "text": "In respect of the State of Uttarakhand, Mr. D.K. Garg, learned counsel appearing for the State,\nsubmits that they had conducted an inspection during the period 01.01.2012 to 20.02.2014, out of which 287 samples of milk were taken and sent to the State Laboratories as well as the Central Laboratory and the presence of detergent, urea, etc. could not be found.",
